<title>POLAND: Polish c.bank ups max 182-day yield to 22.50 pct.</title>
<headline>Polish c.bank ups max 182-day yield to 22.50 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland raised the maximum yield of its 182-day bills by 0.25 point to 22.50 percent and sold 578 millin zlotys worth of the paper against a 584 million demand, the NBP said.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
